[3] the controls -- the same config files, on things they DO reach
    git status --short from docs/ with the guard as shipped           -> ' M faq.md\n'
    git status --short from docs/ with status.relativePaths = true    -> ' M faq.md\n'
    git status --short from docs/ with status.relativePaths = false   -> ' M docs/faq.md\n'
    -> relativePaths=false moves git status, so the file is read, not ignored;
       relativePaths=true matches the guard because true is git own default.
